{"t":"AWK","made":"2026-11-21 01:05","name":"American Water Works Company, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Water","employees":7000,"hq":"Camden, NJ, United States","website":"https://www.amwater.com","summary_en":"American Water Works Company, Inc., through its subsidiaries, provides water and wastewater services in the United States. It offers water and wastewater services on military installations; and undertakes contracts with municipal customers, primarily to operate and manage water and wastewater facilities, as well as offers other related services. The company also operates approximately 80 surface water treatment plants; 520 groundwater treatment plants; 170 wastewater treatment plants; 55,000 miles of transmission, distribution, and collection mains and pipes; 1,200 groundwater wells; 1,800 water and wastewater pumping stations; 1,100 treated water storage facilities; and 75 dams. In addition, it offers water and wastewater services to 14 states serving approximately 3.6 million active customers. The company serves residential customers; commercial customers, including food and beverage providers, commercial property developers and proprietors, and energy suppliers; fire service and private fire customers; industrial customers, such as large-scale manufacturers, mining, and production operations; public authorities comprising government buildings and other public sector facilities, such as schools and universities; and other utilities and community water and wastewater systems. The company was founded in 1886 and is headquartered in Camden, New Jersey.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"American Water Works Company, Inc.는 자회사를 통해 미국에서 물 및 폐수 서비스를 제공합니다. 군사 시설에서 물과 폐수 서비스를 제공합니다. 주로 물과 폐수 시설을 운영 및 관리하고 기타 관련 서비스를 제공하기 위해 지방자치단체 고객과 계약을 체결합니다. 이 회사는 또한 약 80개의 지표수 처리 공장을 운영하고 있습니다. 520개 지하수 처리장; 170개의 폐수 처리장; 55,000마일의 송전, 배전, 수집 본선 및 파이프; 지하수 우물 1,200개; 1,800개의 상하수 펌프장; 1,100개의 처리수 저장 시설; 그리고 75개의 댐. 또한 약 360만 명의 활성 고객에게 서비스를 제공하는 14개 주에 물 및 폐수 서비스를 제공합니다. 회사는 주거용 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 식품 및 음료 제공업체, 상업용 부동산 개발업체 및 소유주, 에너지 공급업체를 포함한 상업 고객; 소방서 및 개인 소방서 고객; 대규모 제조업체, 광업 및 생산 운영과 같은 산업 고객; 정부 건물과 학교, 대학교 등 기타 공공 부문 시설로 구성된 공공 기관 기타 유틸리티, 지역사회 물 및 폐수 시스템. 이 회사는 1886년에 설립되었으며 뉴저지주 캠든에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":152.035,"mcap":30270877696.0,"pe":26.303633,"fpe":23.044336,"peg":2.6272,"ps":5.6655207,"pb":2.5371728,"ev_ebitda":15.442,"div":2.41,"beta":0.545,"hi52":153.69,"lo52":120.57},"fin":{"rev":5343000064.0,"rev_g":0.041,"eps_g":0.0,"gross":0.61856997,"op":0.37675,"net":0.21260999,"roe":0.09948,"fcf":-1630749952.0,"cash":150000000.0,"debt":16426999808.0,"de":137.683,"eps":5.78,"feps":6.5975},"own":{"short":0.1046,"inst":1.1333699,"insider":0.0028},"analyst":{"n":10,"mean":141.4,"median":142.5,"high":157.0,"low":125.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.83333,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-11","Firm":"Argus Research","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":165.0,"priorPriceTarget":155.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":162.0,"priorPriceTarget":153.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":127.0,"priorPriceTarget":130.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":153.0,"priorPriceTarget":162.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-10","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","p